# Browser-visible Google Maps Map Tiles API key (optional).
# Enable Map Tiles API, restrict API and HTTP referrers in Google Cloud.
# Restrict to http://127.0.0.1:3100/* and http://localhost:3100/* for this local app.
# Set an API quota before enabling Google; free usage is limited, not unlimited.
# Copy to .env.local, supply your own key, then rebuild and restart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_TILE_API_KEY=
